# Stylist Payment + Delivery Flow — Walkthrough

## What Was Built

A complete end-to-end stylist workflow inside the Emode messaging system. Verified stylists can request payment from clients, create styled outfits, and deliver them — all within DMs. Payments are currently simulated (UI-first); Stripe Connect is the next phase.

---

## Full User Journey (Step by Step)

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant DMs
    participant Stylist
    participant Create

    Client->>DMs: "I need a fit for a wedding"
    Stylist->>DMs: Taps "$" → sends payment request ($75)
    DMs->>Client: Sees PaymentCard with Accept/Decline
    Client->>DMs: Taps "Accept & Pay" → payment confirmed
    Client->>DMs: Taps "Share Face Photo" → sends selfie
    DMs->>Stylist: Sees face photo + "Create Outfit" button
    Stylist->>Create: Taps "Create Outfit" → enters Create tab
    Note over Create: Banner: "Styling for @username"
    Note over Create: Client's face auto-loaded
    Stylist->>Create: Builds outfit, generates AI image
    Stylist->>Create: Taps "Send to @username"
    Create->>DMs: Outfit delivered as rich card
    DMs->>Client: Sees OutfitDeliveryCard with outfit image + tagged items
```

